{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":634,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["In-Game Reward information"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["It is not possible to get the virtual item attached to this product unless bought through the Roblox commercial store, which is the Merch Shop in the lobby."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"Only players that reside in the United States of America, and are over the age of 13 (unless residing in the state of Texas, where this is over the age of 18) can access this store. Players outside the United States of America are able to purchase the physical product via ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]}," but will not get the virtual item attached to this product."]},"\n"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBA"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Similar Article"]}]},"This article is about ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Mecha Bunny + Nerd Ducky Mini Plush"]},". You may be looking for other uses of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bunny_(Disambiguation)","title":"Bunny (Disambiguation)"},"children":["Bunny"]}," or other uses of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Mini_(Disambiguation)","title":"Mini (Disambiguation)"},"children":["Mini"]},"."]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"Mecha_Bunny_.2B_Nerd_Ducky_Mini_Plush"},"